OL,3,GNEWSAMan who abused vulnerable children
OL,4,Afor three decades jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 77-year-old man who physically and
OL,7,Fsexually abused children over three
OL,8,Fdecades and forced one to run around a
OL,9,Fgarden while carrying tins around his
OL,10,Fneck filled with concrete has been
OL,11,Fjailed for six years.
OL,13,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard that
OL,14,FArchibald Thorburn started abusing his
OL,15,Ffirst victim in July 1963 and continued
OL,16,Ffor 29 years. He also preyed on other
OL,17,Fchildren at the time.
OL,19,FThorburn, from Edinburgh, denied any
OL,20,Fwrongdoing and was found guilty of 14
OL,21,Fcharges and placed on the sex offenders
OL,22,Fregister for life.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
