OL,3,GNEWSAMan who abused vulnerable children
OL,4,Afor three decades jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring sentencing, Judge O'Grady said:
OL,7,F"Even in the face of the most
OL,8,Fdistressing evidence, you have shown
OL,9,Fnot a flicker of emotion - not a hint
OL,10,Fof regret."
